  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indigenous Leadership and Citizenship School</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCSUTCM will launch a school and produce community radio programs that support the development of the current municipality of Mojocoya into a model autonomous campesino originario municipio within the innovative framework of the new Bolivian Constitution. It will select 174 male and female representatives from each of its 30 member communities for training in its school. (BO-520)</narrative>
  </description>
